    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\ntox:6D1E813DD98BAB2A538D5D2B4954BCAA2C7CDC59A36DF8772AE5435535A74863EABD98ECA8C0\n\n### qTox Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Commit Hash\n\nbabd84b915b3efa2e35d7a8f3c00b54faf3aae9c\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Qt Version\n\n6.8.2\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. git clone TokTok/qTox\n2. cd qTox\n3. mkdir _build\n4. cd _build\n5. cmake ..\n6. make\n7. error message and stop:\n```\n.../qTox/src/video/cameradevice.cpp:94:36: error: non-constant condition for static assertion\n   94 | static_assert(toCharArray<12345>() == std::array<char, 6>{'1', '2', '3', '4', '5', '\\0'});\n      |               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      \n.../qTox/src/video/cameradevice.cpp:94:36: error: call to non-'constexpr' function 'bool std::operator==(const std::array<_Tp, _Nm>&, const std::array<_Tp, _Nm>&) [with _Tp = char; long unsigned int _Nm = 6]'\n```\n\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\ncompilation Error\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\ncompilation successful\n\n### Reproducibility\n\nAlways\n\n### Operating System\n\nLinux\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nUbuntu Touch (UBports) > Libertine container (focal based)\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n.../qTox/src/video/cameradevice.cpp:94:36: error: non-constant condition for static assertion\n   94 | static_assert(toCharArray<12345>() == std::array<char, 6>{'1', '2', '3', '4', '5', '\\0'});\n      |               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      \n.../qTox/src/video/cameradevice.cpp:94:36: error: call to non-'constexpr' function 'bool std::operator==(const std::array<_Tp, _Nm>&, const std::array<_Tp, _Nm>&) [with _Tp = char; long unsigned int _Nm = 6]'\n```",
